      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Well, now I am a free man and the dust is starting to settle I can now be FULLY transparent without repercussion. \n\n@GlobalAffairs, aka, @elonmusk picked up the legal tab for my court proceedings these past few months. \n\nThis was only possible due to the relentless hard work of @ezralevant of @RebelNewsOnline who not only brought @laoisedebrun on board with Padraig Langsch, but pressed X legal department to pursue my case in the interests of Free Speech. \n\nWaking up a free man after two years of daily persecution is a strange but liberating feeling. \n\nI will continue to promote http://www.irishfreespeech.com for the cases of @RossLahive1 and Hugh Fagan who are facing Lawfare outside of X's remit and require funding so Laoise and Padraig can clear their names too.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "GlobalAffairs",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1683512189213200385/i554EDOS_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 07:31:32",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-29T23:31:32.000Z",
        "id": "2115949688440463744",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Global Government Affairs",
        "text": "Today, Irish citizen journalist Kirk Loco was acquitted at Bray District Court of a criminal charge under Ireland's \"Coco's Law.\" X is proud to have funded Kirk's defense.\n\nKirk's alleged offense was a single post on X relaying a teenage girl's account of a migrant man exposing himself to her on a local bus. Kirk was arrested at his home and faced up to two years in prison.\n\nThe court found the State had not proved its case. \"Grossly offensive\" speech is not defined anywhere in the law. Vague laws like this invite abuse.\n\nWe will keep standing with users who report on matters of public concern.",
        "url": "https://x.com/GlobalAffairs/status/2115949688440463744",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "organization"
      },
      "retweet": {
        "author": "Polito_loco",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2026991693761830912/ohc1nEcy_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-30 15:58:13",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-30T07:58:13.000Z",
        "id": "2116077196179656963",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Kirk_Loco",
        "text": "Well, now I am a free man and the dust is starting to settle I can now be FULLY transparent without repercussion. \n\n@GlobalAffairs, aka, @elonmusk picked up the legal tab for my court proceedings these past few months. \n\nThis was only possible due to the relentless hard work of @ezralevant of @RebelNewsOnline who not only brought @laoisedebrun on board with Padraig Langsch, but pressed X legal department to pursue my case in the interests of Free Speech. \n\nWaking up a free man after two years of daily persecution is a strange but liberating feeling. \n\nI will continue to promote http://www.irishfreespeech.com for the cases of @RossLahive1 and Hugh Fagan who are facing Lawfare outside of X's remit and require funding so Laoise and Padraig can clear their names too.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Polito_loco/status/2116077196179656963",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
