      "text": "This would be the end of democracy in America",
      "quote": {
        "author": "KanekoaTheGreat",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1612188077333835776/qxjhM55m_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-31 01:34:01",
