      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Every word is James Talarico’s.\n\n“…many more than two biological sexes. In fact, there are six.”\n\n“If you deny your child’s gender identity… it’s abusive for sure.”\n\n“There’s only one person who can determine a child’s gender identity, and that’s the child.”\n\n“I want to acknowledge that our trans community needs abortion care too.”\n\n“…the bill that would have denied gender-affirming health care to trans children… All these ideologies stem from this Christofascism movement.”\n\n“The way I fought for trans kids in the legislature is how I will fight for the U.S. Senate, and my position hasn’t changed.”\n\n“God is non-binary.”\n\n“Neighbors with a uterus.”\n\n“Prophetic voices like Jesus have helped me reckon with my own whiteness.”\n\n“It’s always rich to me that defund the police is considered off limits…”\n\n“Prison is violence.”\n\n“Tear down this secret police force.”\n\nAssault weapons ban? “Absolutely.”\n\nSend this to 10 Texas voters and tell them to go vote today!",
